This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

It is a mutation battery behind a shipped fixture: the JX battery behind `remediator-shard-join`.
It edits copies of the distribution's own `join-remediator-shards.sh`, which a consumer is denied
editing, and its runtime is why the arms and the mutants are separate directories. It sources
`remediator-shard-join/lib.sh`, so it scores the predicates the shipped arms run.
